Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,What if every
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.88,0:00:01.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,NFL team was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.70,0:00:03.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,its actual mascot?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.26,0:00:04.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Vikings?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.18,0:00:05.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,Real Vikings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.12,0:00:06.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,The 49ers?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.26,0:00:08.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,Gold miners from 1849.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.24,0:00:09.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Titans?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.18,0:00:09.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,Actual Titans
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.78,0:00:10.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,from Greek myth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:11.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Jets?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.90,0:00:12.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,Actual Jets.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.96,0:00:13.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Dolphins
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.38,0:00:15.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,are just dolphins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.06,0:00:15.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.92,0:00:16.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Week 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:17.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,Every game.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.76,0:00:18.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Who survives?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.90,0:00:19.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Game 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.90,0:00:20.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Sunday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.70,0:00:22.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,Vikings versus 49ers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.44,0:00:23.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,On paper,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.14,0:00:24.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,it's a massacre.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.36,0:00:25.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,Vikings raided half of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:26.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,Europe in open boats.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.96,0:00:28.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,49ers mostly argued
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.22,0:00:28.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,over who found
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:29.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,the gold first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.96,0:00:31.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,Real records.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:32.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,Minnesota, 7 and 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.46,0:00:33.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,San Francisco, the NFL
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.78,0:00:35.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,best 8 and 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.28,0:00:36.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,Opening kickoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.44,0:00:36.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,Vikings don't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.96,0:00:37.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,return kicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.98,0:00:39.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,They raid them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.12,0:00:40.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,Shield wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.04,0:00:41.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,11 shields, one wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:42.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,Nobody gets through.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.92,0:00:43.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,Touchdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.74,0:00:45.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Vikings, 7-0.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:45.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,Even their quarterback
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.86,0:00:47.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,just sailed home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:47.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,First game back?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.94,0:00:49.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,30-10 over Green Bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.60,0:00:50.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,The 49ers can't break
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.84,0:00:52.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,the wall, so they
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:53.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,do what miners do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.08,0:00:53.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,They dig.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.98,0:00:54.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,Under the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.94,0:00:55.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,Three hours later,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.98,0:00:57.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,a pickaxe pops out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.04,0:00:58.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,of the end zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.02,0:00:58.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Touchdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.90,0:00:59.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,7-7.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.78,0:01:00.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,One miner
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.12,0:01:01.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,pulls out dynamite.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.36,0:01:02.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,Another slaps his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.76,0:01:03.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,It's 1849.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:04.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,That doesn't get
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.38,0:01:06.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,patented until 1867.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.58,0:01:07.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,Fourth quarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.66,0:01:08.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,Vikings driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.42,0:01:09.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then, a miner
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.18,0:01:10.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,opens his pan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.54,0:01:11.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.00,0:01:11.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,And a Viking raid
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.80,0:01:13.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,exists for one reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.60,0:01:14.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,11 Vikings drop
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.50,0:01:15.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,the football and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.28,0:01:16.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,charge the gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:17.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Fumble.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.10,0:01:19.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,49ers lead 14-7.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.22,0:01:20.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,Last play.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.02,0:01:20.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,One Viking rips
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.98,0:01:22.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,off his horned helmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.24,0:01:22.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,Fun fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.92,0:01:23.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,Real Vikings
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.38,0:01:24.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,never wore horns.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.78,0:01:25.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,That came from an
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.28,0:01:27.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,opera costume in 1876.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.44,0:01:28.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,Two pounds lighter, he
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.42,0:01:29.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,leaps over the pile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.78,0:01:30.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,Touchdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.62,0:01:31.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,14-14.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:32.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,Overtime?time?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.68,0:01:33.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,That's Sunday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:35.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,Gold or glory?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.14,0:01:36.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Comment who wins.
